      "after": "caído Calamity, ¿eh?"
    },
    {
      "resource": "SP/talk12_jp.dat",
      "offset": 175080,
      "source": "Call Calamity!! I need some of her dark energy!",
      "before": "¡Invoca a Calamidad!",
      "after": "¡Invoca a Calamity!"
    },
    {
      "resource": "SP/talk12_jp.dat",
      "offset": 176546,
      "source": "And so I decided to use Calamitys power to create a world for myself alone!!",
